uVolley 2023

NEWS

- Trial mode as first option;
- Full play on all views;
- Match statistics;
- Judges line redesigned;
- Gameplay changes;

and more...

Note about Easy Mode :

Easy mode is an option that you find on ball menu and leave the player to automatic movement and play the game by only press the shot buttons, you can uncheck this option in all view when you are ready to full control your player.

